<h2 id="what-these-are">What these are <a class="heading-anchor" href="#what-these-are" aria-label="Permalink to What these are">#</a></h2>

<p>A persona is the character: its voice, rules and memory. An agent is the
runnable package you add to an AI app. Ours are small folders of instructions and
tests, not one-line prompts.</p>

<p>The Drifter, Eris Morn, Zavala, Calus and Ghost all read the same Grimoire
library. That is what keeps them from making up lore when they answer.</p>

